{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"共首函子"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"共首函子"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>共首函子</strong> (initial functor) 是不改变"},{"Local":{"url":"极限","text":"极限"}},{"Plain":"的指标代换, 是"},{"Local":{"url":"共尾函子","text":"共尾函子"}},{"Plain":"的对偶概念.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>命题-定义</strong>. 对于函子 $f\\colon I\\to J$, 若下列等价条件成立, 则称之为<strong>共首函子</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对任意 (有极限的) 图表 $X\\colon J\\to \\mathcal C$, 比较映射 $\\operatorname{lim}_{j\\in J}X_j \\to \\operatorname{lim}_{i\\in I}X_{f(i)}$ 为等价;</li>\n<li>同上一个条件, 但只要求 $\\mathcal C$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" 的情形;</li>\n<li>对任意图表 $X\\colon J\\to \\mathcal C$ 以及 $c\\in\\mathcal C$, 比较映射 $\\operatorname{Hom}(\\operatorname{const}_J c,X)\\to \\operatorname{Hom}(\\operatorname{const}_I c,Xf)$ 为等价;</li>\n<li>对任意 $j\\in J$, 范畴 $(f\\downarrow j):=\\{(i,u\\colon f(i)\\to j)\\}$ "},{"Local":{"url":"弱可缩范畴","text":"弱可缩"}},{"Plain":" (即底层"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"是"},{"Local":{"url":"可缩(同伦类型论)","text":"可缩"}},{"Plain":"的).</li>\n<li>对任意 $j\\in J$,\n$$\r\n  \\int_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_J(f(i),j) = *.\r\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核心观察是由于"},{"Local":{"url":"端","text":"端"}},{"Plain":"的 Fubini 定理,\n$$\r\n    \\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\operatorname{lim}_{i\\in I}X_{f(i)}\r\n    &amp;=\\int_{i\\in I}^*X_{f(i)}\\\\\r\n    &amp;\\simeq\\int_{i\\in I}^*\\int_{j\\in J}^*{\\operatorname{Hom}}{\\big({\\operatorname{Hom}_{J}(f(i),j), X_j}\\big)}\\\\\r\n    &amp;\\simeq\\int_{j\\in J}^*{\\operatorname{Hom}}\\Big(\\int_{i\\in I}\\operatorname{Hom}_{J}(f(i),j), X_j\\Big).\r\n    \\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}